<LanguageData>
  
  <!-- EN: make charcoal -->
  <EM_Make_Charcoal.label>制作木炭</EM_Make_Charcoal.label>
  <!-- EN: Incinerate wood in a closed chamber. Lack of oxygen prevents the wood from completely burning, thus making charcoal. -->
  <EM_Make_Charcoal.description>在封闭空间中焚烧木材。缺氧环境阻止木材完全燃烧，从而制成木炭。</EM_Make_Charcoal.description>
  <!-- EN: Making charcoal. -->
  <EM_Make_Charcoal.jobString>正在制作木炭。</EM_Make_Charcoal.jobString>
  
  <!-- EN: make bulk charcoal -->
  <EM_Make_Charcoal_Bulk.label>制作木炭（批量）</EM_Make_Charcoal_Bulk.label>
  <!-- EN: Incinerate wood in a closed chamber. Lack of oxygen prevents the wood from completely burning, thus making charcoal. -->
  <EM_Make_Charcoal_Bulk.description>在封闭空间中焚烧木材。缺氧环境阻止木材完全燃烧，从而制成木炭。</EM_Make_Charcoal_Bulk.description>
  <!-- EN: Making charcoal. -->
  <EM_Make_Charcoal_Bulk.jobString>正在制作木炭。</EM_Make_Charcoal_Bulk.jobString>
  
  <!-- EN: make chemfuel from coal -->
  <EM_Make_ChemfuelFromCoal.label>从煤炭中制作化工燃料</EM_Make_ChemfuelFromCoal.label>
  <!-- EN: Make a batch of chemfuel by extracting and condensing gas from coal chunks. -->
  <EM_Make_ChemfuelFromCoal.description>通过从煤块中提取和冷凝气体来制作一批化工燃料。</EM_Make_ChemfuelFromCoal.description>
  <!-- EN: Refining chemfuel from coal. -->
  <EM_Make_ChemfuelFromCoal.jobString>正在从煤炭中提炼化工燃料。</EM_Make_ChemfuelFromCoal.jobString>
  
  <!-- EN: make chemfuel from coal (lead) -->
  <EM_Make_ChemfuelFromCoal_Lead.label>从煤炭中制作化工燃料（铅）</EM_Make_ChemfuelFromCoal_Lead.label>
  <!-- EN: Make a batch of lead-based chemfuel by extracting and condensing gas from coal chunks.\n\n<color=#D73333>Warning:</color> Lead makes for a higher yield but causes accumulative lead contamination over time. -->
  <EM_Make_ChemfuelFromCoal_Lead.description>通过从煤块中提取和冷凝气体来制作一批基于铅的化工燃料。\n\n<color=#D73333>警告：</color>铅的产率更高，但会随时间累积导致铅污染。</EM_Make_ChemfuelFromCoal_Lead.description>
  <!-- EN: Refining chemfuel from coal. -->
  <EM_Make_ChemfuelFromCoal_Lead.jobString>正在从煤炭中提炼化工燃料。</EM_Make_ChemfuelFromCoal_Lead.jobString>
  
  <!-- EN: make chemfuel from wood (lead) -->
  <EM_Make_ChemfuelFromWood_Lead.label>从木材中制作化工燃料（铅）</EM_Make_ChemfuelFromWood_Lead.label>
  <!-- EN: Make a batch of lead-based chemfuel by extracting and condensing gas from wood logs.\n\n<color=#D73333>Warning:</color> Lead makes for a higher yield but causes accumulative lead contamination over time. -->
  <EM_Make_ChemfuelFromWood_Lead.description>通过从木材中提取和冷凝气体来制作一批基于铅的化工燃料。\n\n<color=#D73333>警告：</color>铅的产率更高，但会随时间累积导致铅污染。</EM_Make_ChemfuelFromWood_Lead.description>
  <!-- EN: Refining chemfuel from coal. -->
  <EM_Make_ChemfuelFromWood_Lead.jobString>正在从木材中提炼化工燃料。</EM_Make_ChemfuelFromWood_Lead.jobString>
  
